<div class="section">Registration</div>

<p>
CMSB 2026 is an "FLoC associated workshop" with the following registration dates:<br>
- Early bird until <u>June 1st</u><br>
- Late until <u>July 13th</u>

<center><b>
<a href="https://www.floc26.org/registration">https://www.floc26.org/registration</a>
</b></center>
</p>


<p>
Registration of all conferences/workshops will be centrally managed by <a href="https://www.floc26.org">FLoC</a>, including our conference dinner, so <u>please follow these instructions for CMSB</u>:
<ol>
<li>In the "Role" section</li>
<ul><li>Select the appropriate: "Regular"/"Student"/"IEEE member"/...</li></ul>
<li>Select "Workshops Week 2" (and any other conference you might be attending)</li>
<ul><li>Select "Computational Methods in Systems Biology (CMSB) || July 24-25"</li></ul>
<li>In the "Lunches" section</li>
<ul><li>Select "July 24" and "July 25"</li></ul>
<li>In the "Workshop Dinner" section</li>
<ul>
  <li>Select "Workshop Dinner || July 24"</li>
  <li>If your financing body has problems with a detailed "Dinner" item, please read the "Important Notes" section</li>
</ul>
</ol>
Total registration fee (lunches, coffee breaks, and workshop dinner) should be approximately:<br>
- Regular: 280 EUR<br>
- Students: 210 EUR<br>
</p>

